  "details": "https://www.dropbox.com/s/nkhw0hts10ro7nj/King%20Todd.zip?dl=0 King Todd's Avatar World contains several avatars (approximately 50) of them in his avatar world. Most content creators like myself ThotPatrol/KingCrimson with my avatar world Jojo Avatars. My current world which has started the Jojo community Within VRChat. My world got taken down due to TOS because the avatars on my world barely go over the restrictions, while King Todd's world has gotten through multiple updates with 50 or more very un-optimized avatars over the months. Its absoutely unfair that a single content creator who isn't a developer or even a moderator is getting these benefits. He's expressed several times PUBLICLY that he gets either VRPill or Tupper to \" Approve his world\" basically meaning never having his map be truly tested for tos violations. His world may be a featured world and a good supportive backbone for VRChats community but there are serveral other worlds that can do significantly better avatars. It upsets me that us avatar world creators are disappearing.",
